WEBVTT

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:32.209
[Full-Time Magister 2]

00:00:34.218 --> 00:00:37.371
♪ The rising dawn
cuts through the night ♪

00:00:37.625 --> 00:00:40.321
♪ And destroys the darkness ♪

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:44.407
♪ A new wing shall emerge ♪

00:00:44.861 --> 00:00:48.043
♪ And soar through the sky ♪

00:00:48.873 --> 00:00:52.215
♪ Smoke appears
in conflicted dimensions ♪

00:00:52.527 --> 00:00:55.165
♪ Waiting for someone's arrival ♪

00:00:55.547 --> 00:01:00.092
♪ Protecting the unshakable
belief within us ♪

00:01:00.332 --> 00:01:02.230
♪ And never backs down ♪

00:01:02.865 --> 00:01:06.729
♪ The sacred fountain lays there ♪

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:10.491
♪ Shocked by what had
appeared in front of us ♪

00:01:10.877 --> 00:01:13.923
♪ The star atlas has open
a path for our journey ♪

00:01:14.078 --> 00:01:17.363
♪ Laughing while we watch
the world from above ♪

00:01:17.796 --> 00:01:20.898
♪ He had given me everything ♪

00:01:20.992 --> 00:01:25.076
♪ The truth in sight is unpleasant ♪

00:01:25.116 --> 00:01:27.838
♪ Anger that is insurmountable ♪

00:01:27.839 --> 00:01:32.247
♪ That unique soul
was born to be a hero ♪

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:35.517
♪ The torrential rain can't be
stopped by the hot-blooded ♪

00:01:35.557 --> 00:01:39.442
♪ The chosen one will not
bid farewell easily ♪

00:01:39.464 --> 00:01:42.307
♪ I will create a miracle ♪

00:01:42.308 --> 00:01:47.844
♪ With the burning fire
in my wounded heart ♪

00:01:48.051 --> 00:01:52.142
♪ I promise ♪

00:02:04.542 --> 00:02:06.625
This is a path we must take
to go to the school.

00:02:08.432 --> 00:02:10.738
More monsters will appear
when we get closer.

00:02:12.089 --> 00:02:13.302
Let's walk there.

00:02:14.137 --> 00:02:17.193
We'll die if we get assaulted
while in the car.

00:02:18.594 --> 00:02:19.674
I'll scout the road ahead.

00:02:21.309 --> 00:02:22.682
Wind magic, Haste!

00:02:31.278 --> 00:02:33.326
-This is bad.
-Calm down.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:35.958
Wind magic, Floating shadow!

00:02:40.351 --> 00:02:45.143
He's strong. He uses wind magic
to blow the monsters away.

00:02:45.484 --> 00:02:46.755
And didn't sacrifice anyone.

00:02:47.966 --> 00:02:49.166
To mages,

00:02:49.497 --> 00:02:51.630
combat experience is very important.

00:02:52.316 --> 00:02:53.143
Let's move on.

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:58.333
In the past, to get rid of
the Cyclops in the canteen,

00:02:58.872 --> 00:03:00.658
we did some investigations around here.

00:03:01.361 --> 00:03:03.241
Let me lead the way.

00:03:04.639 --> 00:03:07.008
Ice magic, Crushing blow!

00:03:12.823 --> 00:03:14.986
It's an ice magic of Starchart level!
Crushing blow!

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:17.400
It's the intermediate level too.

00:03:18.108 --> 00:03:20.028
Officer Cheng is strong.

00:03:20.775 --> 00:03:22.868
Does Starchart magic
have three categories as well?

00:03:24.919 --> 00:03:27.066
Of course. First, he froze them...

00:03:27.323 --> 00:03:31.018
to prevent them from making any noise.
And to avoid attracting other monsters.

00:03:31.449 --> 00:03:33.696
After that, he crushed them
and killed them instantly.

00:03:34.413 --> 00:03:35.773
I want to get to that level!

00:03:36.846 --> 00:03:39.736
You have a better foundation than me.
You trained in The Sacred Spring too.

00:03:41.082 --> 00:03:43.393
But I feel like something
obstructing me.

00:03:44.926 --> 00:03:47.500
When you reach Level 3,
you would hit a plateau.

00:03:48.039 --> 00:03:49.733
As long as you can get from
Stardust to Nebula,

00:03:50.119 --> 00:03:51.852
you can level up.

00:03:52.318 --> 00:03:54.984
You can reach that level
in a short time.

00:03:55.575 --> 00:03:58.441
When you reach that level, it's harder
for you to incant your magic.

00:03:58.789 --> 00:04:01.695
You can't cast Starchart level
of magic in a short time.

00:04:03.125 --> 00:04:07.375
If I have this, I can skip
the incantations and cast them.

00:04:12.212 --> 00:04:13.279
Help!

00:04:15.588 --> 00:04:17.734
-Officer Cheng!
-Just ignore it.

00:04:18.295 --> 00:04:19.888
-Move on.
-Yes.

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:21.959
Are you guys leaving him?

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:24.227
I've told you this before.

00:04:24.661 --> 00:04:26.675
Our mission is to destroy
the monsters' entrances.

00:04:26.755 --> 00:04:30.045
We'll not save anyone on the way,
even if it's our family.

00:04:30.165 --> 00:04:32.312
Mo Fan is the only one here
to save his family.

00:04:32.916 --> 00:04:33.756
But...

00:04:33.796 --> 00:04:37.859
I hope everyone else knows their parts.

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:39.036
But...

00:04:42.936 --> 00:04:45.990
I've cleaned the area ahead.
Let's go.

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:47.637
Let's go.

00:04:55.083 --> 00:04:55.750
Help...

00:04:56.209 --> 00:04:56.793
me.

00:04:57.751 --> 00:04:58.751
Help me.

00:05:08.949 --> 00:05:10.562
We don't have signs of conflicts here.

00:05:11.246 --> 00:05:13.353
I think they're trying to leave
by using the sewers.

00:05:13.757 --> 00:05:14.584
But...

00:05:15.527 --> 00:05:18.381
The sewers is the nest of the Cyclops.

00:05:19.149 --> 00:05:20.936
They're just trying to kill themselves.

00:05:21.748 --> 00:05:22.428
Let's go.

00:05:22.543 --> 00:05:25.151
There'll be more casualties
if we don't destroy the entrances.

00:05:38.007 --> 00:05:40.557
Brother Mo Fan.
Which one is better?

00:05:45.421 --> 00:05:47.491
How about this? This is unique.

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:52.160
This bracelet means that
you're unique to me.

00:05:55.501 --> 00:05:59.543
You said this to Mu Ningxue as well.

00:06:00.976 --> 00:06:02.123
I didn't!

00:06:02.259 --> 00:06:03.659
When did that happen?

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:05.237
But now I thought about it,

00:06:05.877 --> 00:06:09.456
this bracelet has too many
colours in it. It's not beautiful.

00:06:10.748 --> 00:06:11.628
Never mind.

00:06:11.918 --> 00:06:14.168
Because this is something you gave me.

00:06:33.482 --> 00:06:35.602
This is Xinxia's bracelet.

00:06:37.336 --> 00:06:37.976
Mo Fan.

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:39.876
It's someone else.

00:06:40.594 --> 00:06:41.701
But I have a clue now.

00:06:42.435 --> 00:06:43.235
What happened?

00:06:44.035 --> 00:06:45.741
She's wearing Xinxia's bracelet.

00:06:46.678 --> 00:06:50.284
She must've met Xinxia
while she was alive.

00:06:51.171 --> 00:06:54.318
That guy wore the uniform of the
supermarket in Epigraph Mall.

00:06:54.834 --> 00:06:58.209
I think they may have entered
the sewers through the supermarket.

00:06:58.502 --> 00:07:02.409
And they got assaulted
by the Cyclops in the sewers.

00:07:02.691 --> 00:07:04.144
That's why they came back
to the surface.

00:07:04.874 --> 00:07:06.674
My men have investigated
the sewers before.

00:07:06.941 --> 00:07:08.221
Your sister is not there.

00:07:09.164 --> 00:07:10.884
You can check the supermarket.

00:07:11.724 --> 00:07:12.631
I'll go now.

00:07:13.299 --> 00:07:15.893
But, that's all I can do for you.

00:07:16.383 --> 00:07:18.383
We're going to
Epigraph Girls Junior High now.

00:07:19.021 --> 00:07:19.981
We have to part ways here.

00:07:20.728 --> 00:07:22.048
Mo Fan, good luck.

00:07:23.023 --> 00:07:23.876
You too.

00:07:24.687 --> 00:07:26.247
We'll part ways then.

00:07:41.816 --> 00:07:45.550
This is weird. If that Xinxia
is in the supermarket,

00:07:46.047 --> 00:07:47.980
why didn't she follow the crowd?

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:51.127
Oh. She can't walk.

00:07:51.646 --> 00:07:54.139
The sewers is hard for
normal people to traverse.

00:07:54.455 --> 00:07:57.135
It means that she's abandoned by them.

00:07:57.229 --> 00:07:58.103
I think so.

00:07:58.333 --> 00:08:00.307
She must feel bad about this.

00:08:00.959 --> 00:08:04.168
I hope she won't give up on herself
because of these people.

00:08:04.388 --> 00:08:06.708
And buy some time
for Mo Fan to save her.

00:08:49.575 --> 00:08:51.562
That door can't last long.

00:08:52.122 --> 00:08:53.162
What should I do?

00:09:23.331 --> 00:09:25.654
Not enough.
This is far not enough.

00:09:26.247 --> 00:09:28.420
We should wipe the entire city out.

00:09:28.847 --> 00:09:29.954
Especially...

00:09:30.122 --> 00:09:32.576
I don't know what
the Archeacon is thinking.

00:09:32.942 --> 00:09:35.156
Why are we placed here?

00:09:35.688 --> 00:09:37.848
I'm sure Bow City will be wiped out.

00:09:38.021 --> 00:09:39.501
What's there for us to monitor?

00:09:40.489 --> 00:09:42.369
There's a small group
of military personnels.

00:09:42.662 --> 00:09:45.808
They're approaching the entrances
in Epigraph Girls Junior High.

00:09:47.073 --> 00:09:48.619
I'm sure they've discovered that.

00:09:48.846 --> 00:09:50.326
How did they discover it?

00:09:50.973 --> 00:09:53.066
This is bad.
We need to stop them.

00:09:53.651 --> 00:09:57.851
I'm still waiting for the massacre
in Bow City, you know?

00:09:58.526 --> 00:10:01.993
That area has the most Cyclops
and One-eyed Wolf Demons.

00:10:02.567 --> 00:10:05.127
They're just trying to kill themselves.

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:07.700
Let's wait for their numbers to die out.

00:10:08.424 --> 00:10:10.477
We'll wipe them out after that.

00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:13.130
We'll kill every single one of them.

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:15.857
It's a pity we didn't get the Sacred Spring.

00:10:16.306 --> 00:10:18.466
or else, everything would be easier.

00:10:24.413 --> 00:10:27.613
Wow. It's rare to see
some purple flashes.

00:10:28.613 --> 00:10:30.506
It's a lightning mage.

00:10:33.635 --> 00:10:34.675
It's him.

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:36.544
Hey.

00:10:36.792 --> 00:10:40.792
Shall we kill him?
A rare lightning mage?

00:10:41.417 --> 00:10:42.126
No.

00:10:42.542 --> 00:10:44.709
I'll kill him myself.

00:10:44.874 --> 00:10:45.967
You know him?

00:10:46.573 --> 00:10:47.640
Of course.

00:10:47.935 --> 00:10:49.068
Wait here.

00:10:49.496 --> 00:10:50.910
I'll kill him now.

00:10:51.233 --> 00:10:52.860
Can you do kill him by yourself?

00:10:53.315 --> 00:10:55.022
Don't take too much time.

00:10:55.075 --> 00:10:56.742
We have a mission to do.

00:10:57.193 --> 00:10:57.913
I know.

00:11:20.039 --> 00:11:21.132
That was...

00:11:31.780 --> 00:11:33.260
You avoided that well.

00:11:33.801 --> 00:11:34.815
But this time,

00:11:35.072 --> 00:11:37.992
you won't survive.

00:11:38.388 --> 00:11:39.241
Who's there?

00:11:42.984 --> 00:11:44.504
Did you forget me already?

00:11:46.682 --> 00:11:49.775
Yeah. I can't even
recognise myself anymore.

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:56.188
You! You're Yu Ang?

00:11:59.557 --> 00:12:00.544
Didn't you recognise me?

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:06.584
My face became like this because of you.

00:12:08.918 --> 00:12:12.144
Since young, I was in the Mu family.
I'm treated like a dog by Mu Zhuoyun.

00:12:12.426 --> 00:12:14.546
I was bullied by him for 10 years.

00:12:15.339 --> 00:12:16.433
All for what?

00:12:16.869 --> 00:12:18.776
It's because of The Sacred Spring!

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:22.839
In the end? When my mission
was almost complete,

00:12:23.196 --> 00:12:24.462
you appeared!

00:12:24.896 --> 00:12:27.562
And jeopardised my plans
to please the Black Curia!

00:12:29.509 --> 00:12:30.429
My face.

00:12:30.939 --> 00:12:31.993
My face!

00:12:32.459 --> 00:12:37.251
This is my punishment for
failing the mission!

00:12:38.417 --> 00:12:39.876
You may not recognise me,

00:12:40.468 --> 00:12:41.495
but you, Mo Fan,

00:12:41.739 --> 00:12:43.539
I remember your face forever!

00:12:43.714 --> 00:12:46.095
You're part of the Black Curia as well?

00:12:46.987 --> 00:12:48.907
I'm so close!

00:12:49.212 --> 00:12:50.732
I was supposed to complete it!

00:12:51.223 --> 00:12:52.637
If I got The Sacred Spring,

00:12:52.820 --> 00:12:55.780
Bow City would be dead by now!

00:12:56.081 --> 00:12:58.534
And I would be in a higher rank!

00:13:00.083 --> 00:13:02.959
But you robbed me of the chance
when you deny me my entrance!

00:13:03.165 --> 00:13:05.125
And I turned into this because of you!

00:13:05.262 --> 00:13:06.062
Today,

00:13:06.191 --> 00:13:08.698
I will tear you apart, piece by piece.

00:13:09.185 --> 00:13:11.915
To appease my hatred for you!

00:13:12.324 --> 00:13:13.791
But you can't win.

00:13:15.352 --> 00:13:18.072
Did you think that you're
the only one with hidden abilities?

00:13:31.034 --> 00:13:33.683
Mobs like these, they're worthless.

00:13:39.029 --> 00:13:41.966
My goodness! How can he summon
such a large number of them?

00:13:43.361 --> 00:13:46.428
I thought you can use two elements?

00:13:47.029 --> 00:13:49.002
Now,

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:53.250
let's see who's stronger.
Your elements or my pets?

00:13:54.204 --> 00:13:55.178
This is great.

00:13:56.112 --> 00:14:00.752
I can witness your gruesome
death before it ends.

00:14:01.244 --> 00:14:04.331
And witness your helplessness.

00:14:07.359 --> 00:14:08.891
I don't have time for this!

00:14:10.206 --> 00:14:10.939
Follow him!

00:14:16.084 --> 00:14:17.626
Hiss of Fire, Explode!

00:14:28.712 --> 00:14:31.173
This is bad!
I need to find Xinxia now!

00:14:33.918 --> 00:14:38.713
Even if you have two elements,
they're useless in front of my servants.

00:14:49.355 --> 00:14:50.208
Yu Ang.

00:14:50.532 --> 00:14:54.186
The military personnels
have reached the school.

00:14:54.724 --> 00:14:56.684
Our higher-ups told us
to act accordingly.

00:14:56.902 --> 00:14:57.769
Come here now.

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:00.360
I'm busy!

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:04.876
If they know you left your duties,
they'll leave a scar on you again.

00:15:12.292 --> 00:15:13.584
It's a pity.

00:15:13.933 --> 00:15:15.973
I can't witness your death myself.

00:15:16.768 --> 00:15:20.048
You can play with my servants then.

00:15:20.603 --> 00:15:22.243
But it doesn't matter.

00:15:23.052 --> 00:15:26.992
I'll come for your body
after I've settled everything.

00:15:41.604 --> 00:15:44.338
There are too many of them!
I can't deal with them!

00:15:47.758 --> 00:15:48.811
I'm surrounded?

00:16:03.886 --> 00:16:06.019
Please! Let me open this door!

00:16:17.876 --> 00:16:18.756
With this amount,

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:23.010
I can only deal with them if
I can use Starchart magic.

00:16:40.622 --> 00:16:41.248
That's...

00:16:57.101 --> 00:16:57.901
Xin...

00:16:59.218 --> 00:17:00.190
Xinxia!

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:24.475
♪ Pressing onward courageously ♪

00:17:25.178 --> 00:17:28.588
♪ With the burning dreams in our heart ♪

00:17:28.858 --> 00:17:31.909
♪ We are reminiscing
the dreams of our past ♪

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:34.030
♪ And it gives me strength ♪

00:17:34.431 --> 00:17:36.324
♪ The most stubborn wings ♪

00:17:36.938 --> 00:17:39.984
♪ Dreamt that we will
not wander anymore ♪

00:17:40.316 --> 00:17:44.241
♪ And hoped that we will
fly further one day ♪

00:17:45.714 --> 00:17:49.639
♪ With the dim lights
shining through the sky ♪

00:17:50.632 --> 00:17:55.579
♪ Shine through our heart
and fill in the ups and downs ♪

00:17:56.640 --> 00:17:59.901
♪ I'm as proud as the sun ♪

00:18:00.213 --> 00:18:03.067
♪ The clouds are moving
in the distance ♪

00:18:03.334 --> 00:18:05.659
♪ Since I have decided to be unique ♪

00:18:05.802 --> 00:18:08.710
♪ I will break all barriers
and shine through ♪

00:18:09.035 --> 00:18:11.757
♪ Life is ever-changing ♪

00:18:11.892 --> 00:18:15.309
♪ But I will soar through the sky ♪

00:18:15.635 --> 00:18:17.604
♪ The hope that is beating within me ♪

00:18:18.176 --> 00:18:21.273
♪ Writes a new chapter for me ♪

00:18:21.818 --> 00:18:25.657
♪ We will battle once more
if we have the chance ♪

00:18:26.245 --> 00:18:32.482
♪ To be the everlasting light
in the world ♪
